# This restriction applies only to the SwiftPM example app. The library itself
# continues to support CocoaPods through CookieManager.podspec, as exercised by
# the regular example app.
#
# This project intentionally builds with Swift Package Manager only. React
# Native CLI 20.2 still discovers the iOS project by looking for a Podfile, so
# this stub keeps `react-native spm` and Xcode's autolinking sync working.
#
# Running `pod install` here would mix CocoaPods with the already-injected
# SwiftPM graph and could link React Native or this library twice. Fail clearly
# instead of silently turning this SPM verification project into a hybrid.
raise 'CookieManagerExampleSpm uses Swift Package Manager. Do not run ' \
      '`pod install` here. Use ../example to test CocoaPods.'
